1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,000
Here’s Sofia’s first shift, without the virtual machine.

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:08,200
Harborline HR owns the hire, property and manager details that Entra reacts to.

3
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:12,200
The Front Desk asks for a workforce session and hands the browser to Microsoft.

4
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:19,000
Sofia enters her demo username. Her password stays masked, and no real credential is stored in this recording.

5
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:24,600
A read-only Graph call confirms her enabled account, property groups, passkey cohort and Front Desk assignment.

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:29,800
She comes back to the app under her own name, with the right property ready.

7
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:34,000
Now the identity story becomes real work. Sofia opens the arrival list.

8
00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:38,600
She opens Maya’s reservation and picks a ready room.

9
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:42,500
Room seven fourteen is selected, then the check-in is committed.

10
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:47,400
The guest status changes immediately. Maya is now in house.

11
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:52,400
At the end of the shift, the shared desk is cleared for the next colleague.
